      "kind": "narrative",
      "text": "For January 8, the Turkish Airlines business-cabin award via Los Angeles is one option, arriving in Bangkok at 4:15 a.m. on January 10. It arrives earlier than the later-arriving business award, but another shown award reaches Bangkok at the same time with a slightly shorter reported elapsed time. All three require a separate SFO–LAX ticket; award-seat availability and taxes are not reliably reported.",
      "label": null,
      "reference_kind": null,
      "canonical_id": null,
      "journey": null,
      "component": null,
      "lead": null,
      "unavailable": false
    },
    {
      "kind": "reference",
